# .worktree-yolo — per-repo manifest for git-worktree-yolo (commit this at your repo root)
#
# Extends the built-in defaults. One directive per line; '#' starts a comment.
# git-worktree-yolo already syncs gitignored machine-local config (.env, keys, IDE run
# configs, Android local.properties, *.xcconfig, keystores) and skips heavy/regenerable
# dirs (node_modules, .venv, Pods, target, .gradle, build, dist, …). Use this file only
# for project-specific cases the defaults miss.

# force-sync a gitignored file the skip-list would otherwise drop
# (e.g. a secret living inside a normally-skipped dir):
# sync  config/credentials/staging.key

# never sync a particular gitignored path:
# skip  db/seeds/local-dump.sql

# custom "if this dir is missing in the worktree, suggest this command":
# recreate  node_modules  -- pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
# recreate  .venv         -- uv sync
